 'create.capacity_explain':["The number of people shapes the composition: {n} people, {n} regions.","인원수가 구도를 정합니다. {n}명이면 {n}개 구역으로 나뉩니다.","Le nombre de personnes détermine la composition : {n} personnes, {n} zones.","Het aantal personen bepaalt de compositie: {n} personen, {n} vlakken."],
